+
+**`tickets.status` (enum):**
+
+| Value | Meaning |
+| ----- | ------- |
+| `waiting` | Issued and still in the waiting queue |
+| `called` | Called by an attendant |
+
+No `cancelled` status in MVP; cancellation (if added later) is a separate operation, not a status flip.
+
+**`tickets.channel` (enum):**
+
+| Value | Meaning |
+| ----- | ------- |
+| `totem` | Issued at a physical totem |
+| `virtual` | Issued without physical presence at a totem |
+| `printed` | Printed copy / ESC/POS path |
+
+**Issuance:** domain action `App\Actions\IssueTicket` rejects inactive queues (`is_active = false`), requires `priority >= 0`, allocates the next code, and creates a ticket with `status=waiting` and `issued_at` set.
